    <h2>Configuration Jar</h2>
    <p>Note the associated file
    &quot;<strong>esapi-2.6.2.0-configuration.jar</strong>&quot; contains
    the default ESAPI configuration
    files under 'configuration/' (ESAPI.properties, validation.properties,
